    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are delighted to present to the market this charming, lovingly restored and renovated property, ideally nestled along a quiet country lane leading to open farmland in the heart of scenic countryside, close to the Carlow/Wicklow border.\n\nExtending to approximately 90 m², this beautifully presented home is in excellent condition throughout and combines character and charm with a bright, comfortable living environment.\n\nA number of features add to the appeal of the property, including attractive vaulted timber ceilings, a mix of wood and ceramic flooring, and a fully fitted country-style kitchen. Velux windows throughout allow an abundance of natural light to flood the accommodation, creating a bright, airy and welcoming atmosphere.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming porch, hallway, living room, kitchen/diner, three bedrooms (with the master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite) and a main bathroom.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a sunny position with a sheltered, south-facing garden overlooking the surrounding countryside, providing a peaceful and private setting to enjoy the outdoors.\n\nRathnafushogue is a tranquil rural setting, while remaining within easy reach of local amenities and larger towns. Dublin is approximately one hour's commute, while Carlow town is around 30 minutes by car.\n\nThe nearby town of Hacketstown, approximately 1km away, provides a good range of everyday amenities including primary and secondary schools, SuperValu supermarket, GP surgery, pharmacy, shops, pubs, service station, GAA grounds and a children's playground.\n\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a character-filled countryside home in a peaceful location, while still being within convenient reach of essential amenities and commuter routes.\n\nTo view current offers or place an offer on this property, register for your MyDNG account at mydng.ie.\n\nViewings are strictly by appointment. For further information or to arrange a viewing, contact DNG McCormack Properties on 059 913 3800."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nFront Porch - 2.94 x 1.30\nTiled floor, velux windows.\n\nHallway - 5.12 x 1.06\nWood flooring, curved wood ceiling, storage.\n\nLiving Room - 4.55 x 3.49\nBright dual aspect room with vaulted wood ceiling, wood flooring, feature chimney breast with large solid-fuel stove, patio doors to rear.\n\nKitchen / Diner - 4.76 x 4.20\nTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen units at floor and eye level, tiled splashback, integrated appliances, velux windows, pendant lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.10 x 4.26\nLaminate flooring, timber ceiling, built-in wardrobes, en-suite.\n\nEn-suite - 0.87 x 3.08\nLaminate flooring, WC, WHB, shower, velux window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.06 x 4.13\nLaminate flooring, standard window and velux window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.21 x 2.95\nLaminate flooring, timber ceiling, feature window & velux window.\n\nBathroom - 1.82 x 3.09\nLinoleum flooring, tiled splash area, WC, WHB, bath, timber ceiling.\n\n"
